# requires: sloppy
# a matrix prints a row a line, lined up (to_text and inside lists: exact, one line); not on a
# mask; NAN; variance of whole numbers; max and min of three
m = [1.5 2.0; -3.25 40.0]
print(m)
print([1 20; 300 4])
print(to_text(m), [m])
xs = [1.0, NAN, 3.0]
print(not is_nan.(xs), mean(xs[not is_nan.(xs)]), NAN == NAN, is_nan(NAN))
print(variance([1, 2, 3, 4]), max(1, 5, 3), min(2.5, 1.0, 3.0))
